Subject: [PATCH] feat(boundary): OB-2 hold-and-answer convergence through One
 Brain

Rooms ask Boundary + permitsFor (via roomTurnVerdict) before storing or
advancing; clarify/ask/unsure/correct/bare-yes-to-open-question hold and the
specialist explains its own question. Boundary transition reconciled with
meaning. Kill switch NEXT_PUBLIC_BOUNDARY_MEANING_HOLD=0 restores OB-1
behavior (proved cell-for-cell).

